17] [17592186416503 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186416488 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416503 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186416489 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416503 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186416490 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416503 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186416497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416503 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186416500 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416503 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416503 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416503 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186416497 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416503 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "b3019da1-a157-5528-94a6-85caf91d61fd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416504 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186416491 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416504 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186416493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416504 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186416495 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416504 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186416498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416504 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186416499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416504 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416504 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416504 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186416498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416504 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "b7baad12-38b1-5f0c-9519-c9cab1926772" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416505 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186416492 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416505 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186416494 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416505 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186416496 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416505 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186416501 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416505 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186416502 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416505 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416505 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416505 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186416494 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416505 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "fd07d7b1-6cdf-5103-98fc-8aa75014e305" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416506 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186416503 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416506 #edb/ref 1069 "q-148377" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416506 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416506 #edb/ref 1071 "| $f(x,y)$ | $Y=-4$ | $Y=0$ | $Y=2$ | ${f}_{X}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=0$ | $0.16$ | $0.17$ | $0.19$ | $0.52$ |\n| $X=10$ | $0.15$ | $0.17$ | $0.16$ | $0.48$ |\n| ${f}_{Y}$ | $0.31$ | $0.34$ | $0.35$ | $1$ |\n\nThe joint probability mass function $f(x,y)$ for the discrete random variables $X$ and $Y$ is shown above. Given that \n\n$$\n\\text{E}[X]=4.8,\\,\\text{E}[Y]=-0.54,\\,\\text{SD}[X]≈4.9960,\\,\\text{SD}[Y]≈2.4634,\n$$\n\n \nfind the correlation coefficient of $X$ and $Y.$ Round your answer to $2$ decimal places." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416506 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "71621138-ed93-53b4-9ace-266f4a0d5dab" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416506 #edb/ref 1074 "Recall that the correlation coefficient of random variables $X$ and $Y$ is defined as\n\n$$\n\\rho =\\frac{\\text{Cov}[X,Y]}{\\text{SD}[X]\\cdot \\text{SD}[Y]},\n$$\n\nwhere\n\n- $\\text{Cov}[X,Y]$ is the covariance, and\n\n- $\\text{SD}[X]$ and $\\text{SD}[Y]$ are the standard deviations of $X$ and $Y.$\n\nFirst, by applying the rule of the lazy statistician, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[XY] & ={\\sum }_{x\\in {S}_{X}}{\\sum }_{y\\in {S}_{Y}}xy\\,f(x,y) \\\\  & =0\\cdot (-4)\\cdot 0.16+0\\cdot 0\\cdot 0.17+0\\cdot 2\\cdot 0.19 \\\\  & +10\\cdot (-4)\\cdot 0.15+10\\cdot 0\\cdot 0.17+10\\cdot 2\\cdot 0.16 \\\\  & =-2.8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we compute the covariance and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Cov}[X,Y] & =\\text{E}[XY]-\\text{E}[X]\\cdot \\text{E}[Y] \\\\  & =-2.8-(4.8)(-0.54) \\\\  & =-0.208.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correlation coefficient is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\rho  & =\\frac{\\text{Cov}[X,Y]}{\\text{SD}[X]\\cdot \\text{SD}[Y]} \\\\  & ≈\\frac{-0.208}{4.9960\\cdot 2.4634} \\\\  & ≈-0.02,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nrounded to $2$ decimal places." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416507 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "64154ed0-ecd2-5a93-a53c-c88a0fff494a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416507 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186416506 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416508 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186416509 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416508 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "a8c3d0f3-7ae4-57cd-aeb8-05d8cdcf0700" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416508 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186162442 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416509 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186416507 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416509 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "c917e351-229c-5962-9db6-66543286f0e6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186416509 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186162446 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
